---

This product bundles Gson 2.10.1 — Apache License 2.0
(https://github.com/google/gson). Gson is used by the response body walker
to parse JSON values without a schema.

This product bundles SnakeYAML 2.7 — Apache License 2.0
(https://bitbucket.org/snakeyaml/snakeyaml). SnakeYAML loads the built-in
detection rule files (rules/*.yaml) with its safe constructor.

Some detection rule formats are adapted from Betterleaks
(https://github.com/betterleaks/betterleaks), MIT License,
Copyright (c) the Betterleaks authors. Those rules are marked
"source: betterleaks" in rules/*.yaml.

This product bundles detection rules converted from the Kingfisher
rule catalog (https://github.com/mongodb/kingfisher), Apache License 2.0,
Copyright (c) MongoDB, Inc. and the Kingfisher authors. The patterns were
transformed to SecretSifter's rule schema; those rules are marked
"source: kingfisher-betterleaks" and "license: Apache-2.0" in rules/*.yaml.
A copy of the Apache License 2.0 governs these rules; see
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.

